Subject: Cantor Semantic Anchor Catalogue P0 Slice5A Exploded Requirements

@ [exploded_uuid] 45f79e09-70be-4fc4-a343-daa39bef242d
@ [canonical_uuid] 9a815af3-6ea0-4828-8233-83a20a0aa122

& [Inputs]
  + one tracked strict corpus manifest and exactly its declared documents
  + fixed in-memory signing seeds used only to reproduce the already-governed test corpus package

& [Pipeline]
  + parse and bound manifest then load bounded documents
  + build sign admit and construct immutable fabric through existing public functions
  + derive catalogue and lexical index once
  + for every declared query run lexical lookup exact semantic gate and compact projection
  + account complete versus eligible ambiguous excluded unresolved and unmatched results
  + serialize one canonical report whose digest excludes only its own digest field

& [Refusals]
  + unknown JSON fields invalid profile empty or excessive inputs partial results proof drift report tamper and replay mismatch refuse
  + no elapsed-time or allocation surrogate may be presented as a measurement
  + no corpus ingestion constitutes neural training approval

& [Bounds]
  + [maximum_documents] 16
  + [maximum_queries] 128
  + [maximum_records_per_query] 4096
  + [maximum_report_bytes] 67108864

& [Outputs]
  + checked deterministic JSON and provider-free verifier executable
  + explicit non-authority and readiness-gap statements
